second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What position does Moussa Sylla play in?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0225-6d373af2570f:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 143, \"text\": \"Moussa Sylla (footballer, born 1989) Moussa Sylla (born 15 June 1989) is a Ivorian professional footballer who plays as a Defensive Midfielder.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0225-6d373af2570f:d00\", \"start\": 144, \"end\": 175, \"text\": \"Sylla began 2002 on youth side.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0225-6d373af2570f:d00\", \"start\": 176, \"end\": 319, \"text\": \"In the spring of 2003 signed in Côte d'Ivoire with Ecole de Football Yéo Martial and was here a year later (2004) promoted into the first team.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0225-6d373af2570f:d00\", \"start\": 320, \"end\": 425, \"text\": \"He left after 30 games in two years on professional level for EFYM in January 2005 to Royal Thai Army FC.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0225-6d373af2570f:d00\", \"start\": 426, \"end\": 554, \"text\": \"Sylla was by Royal Thai Army named as Best foreign Player and signed than in February 2009 for Muangthong United, who won in his\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0225-6d373af2570f:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 131, \"text\": \"Moussa Sylla (footballer, born 1989) Moussa Sylla (born 15 June 1989) is an Ivorian professional footballer who plays as a Forward.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0225-6d373af2570f:d01\", \"start\": 132, \"end\": 167, \"text\": \"Sylla began 2002 on the youth side.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0225-6d373af2570f:d01\", \"start\": 168, \"end\": 308, \"text\": \"In the spring of 2003, he signed with Côte d'Ivoire's Ecole de Football Yéo Martial and was promoted to the first team a year later in 2004.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0225-6d373af2570f:d01\", \"start\": 309, \"end\": 423, \"text\": \"He left after 30 games in two years at the professional level for EFYM in January 2005 to join Royal Thai Army FC.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0225-6d373af2570f:d01\", \"start\": 424, \"end\": 572, \"text\": \"Sylla was named the Best Foreign Player by Royal Thai Army and subsequently signed with Muangthong United in February 2009, where they won in his...\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0225-6d373af2570f:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 154, \"text\": \"Moussa Sylla (footballer, born 1999) Moussa Sylla (born 25 November 1999) is a French professional footballer who plays as a winger for Monaco in Ligue 1.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0225-6d373af2570f:d02\", \"start\": 155, \"end\": 273, \"text\": \"On 10 February 2017, Sylla signed his first professional contract with Monaco keeping him at the club until June 2020.\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0225-6d373af2570f:d02\", \"start\": 274, \"end\": 379, \"text\": \"He made his professional debut for Monaco in a 3–1 Ligue 1 loss to En Avant de Guingamp on 21 April 2018.\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0225-6d373af2570f:d02\", \"start\": 380, \"end\": 538, \"text\": \"He scored his first professional goals on his first start on 6 May 2018, finding the back of the net both times in a 2–1 away victory against Caen in Ligue 1.\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0225-6d373af2570f:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 388, \"text\": \"Moussa Sylla - stats , career and market value News About us Moussa Sylla Schalke 04 Follow Height 9 Shirt 25 y